## Bubble frontend environment
##
## Preferred setup: keep these values in the repo root `.env`
## and run frontend via the package scripts, which preload `../.env`.
##
## Expo only exposes variables prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_`.
##
## Recommended local values:
## EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:4000/api      (Android emulator)
## EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api     (iOS simulator / web)
## EXPO_PUBLIC_KHALTI_ENV=TEST
##
## Bubble opens Khalti's official `payment_url` in a mobile WebView and verifies
## the result with the backend using `pidx`.
##
## EXPO_PUBLIC_KHALTI_PUBLIC_KEY is optional and unused by the current app flow.
